{"suttaId":"thag15.2","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[2790,2842],"vripara":"689"},"segments":{"thag15.2:0.4":"Udāyittheragāthā","thag15.2:1.1":"[a. ni.6.43]“Manussabhūtaṃ sambuddhaṃ, attadantaṃ samāhitaṃ;","thag15.2:1.3":"Iriyamānaṃ brahmapathe, cittassūpasame rataṃ.","thag15.2:2.1":"“Yaṃ manussā namassanti, sabbadhammāna pāraguṃ;","thag15.2:2.3":"Devāpi taṃ namassanti, iti me arahato sutaṃ.","thag15.2:3.1":"“Sabbasaṃyojanātītaṃ, vanā nibbanamāgataṃ;","thag15.2:3.3":"Kāmehi nekkhammarataṃ [nikkhammarataṃ (ka.)], muttaṃ selāva kañcanaṃ.","thag15.2:4.1":"“Sa ve accaruci nāgo, himavāvaññe siluccaye;","thag15.2:4.3":"Sabbesaṃ nāganāmānaṃ, saccanāmo anuttaro.","thag15.2:5.1":"“Nāgaṃ vo kittayissāmi, na hi āguṃ karoti so;","thag15.2:5.3":"Soraccaṃ avihiṃsā ca, pādā nāgassa te duve.","thag15.2:6.1":"“Sati ca sampajaññañca, caraṇā nāgassa tepare;","thag15.2:6.3":"Saddhāhattho mahānāgo, upekkhāsetadantavā.","thag15.2:7.1":"“Sati gīvā siro paññā, vīmaṃsā dhammacintanā;","thag15.2:7.3":"Dhammakucchisamāvāso, viveko tassa vāladhi.","thag15.2:8.1":"“So jhāyī assāsarato, ajjhattaṃ susamāhito;","thag15.2:8.3":"Gacchaṃ samāhito nāgo, ṭhito nāgo samāhito.","thag15.2:9.1":"“Sayaṃ samāhito nāgo, nisinnopi samāhito;","thag15.2:9.3":"Sabbattha saṃvuto nāgo, esā nāgassa sampadā.","thag15.2:10.1":"“Bhuñjati anavajjāni, sāvajjāni na bhuñjati;","thag15.2:10.3":"Ghāsamacchādanaṃ laddhā, sannidhiṃ parivajjayaṃ.","thag15.2:11.1":"“Saṃyojanaṃ aṇuṃ thūlaṃ, sabbaṃ chetvāna bandhanaṃ;","thag15.2:11.3":"Yena yeneva gacchati, anapakkhova gacchati.","thag15.2:12.1":"“Yathāpi udake jātaṃ, puṇḍarīkaṃ pavaḍḍhati;","thag15.2:12.3":"Nopalippati toyena, sucigandhaṃ manoramaṃ.","thag15.2:13.1":"“Tatheva ca loke jāto, buddho loke viharati;","thag15.2:13.3":"Nopalippati lokena, toyena padumaṃ yathā.","thag15.2:14.1":"“Mahāgini pajjalito, anāhāropasammati;","thag15.2:14.3":"Aṅgāresu ca santesu, nibbutoti pavuccati.","thag15.2:15.1":"“Atthassāyaṃ viññāpanī, upamā viññūhi desitā;","thag15.2:15.3":"Viññissanti mahānāgā, nāgaṃ nāgena desitaṃ.","thag15.2:16.1":"“Vītarāgo vītadoso, vītamoho anāsavo;","thag15.2:16.3":"Sarīraṃ vijahaṃ nāgo, parinibbissatyanāsavo”ti.","thag15.2:16.5":"… Udāyī thero ….","thag15.2:16.6":"Soḷasakanipāto niṭṭhito.","thag15.2:17.0":"Tatruddānaṃ –","thag15.2:17.1":"Koṇḍañño ca udāyī ca, therā dve te mahiddhikā;","thag15.2:17.3":"Soḷasamhi nipātamhi, gāthāyo dve ca tiṃsa cāti."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
